Bestiary: {
	ImportantFlavorText: Hello! Im new NPC
	NPC_Copper_1: It's amazing that this slime is covered with pure copper and it manages to jump so high, it's a pity that it can't be sold, although it won't cost much.
	NPC_Copper_2: It's amazing how this demonic eye, covered with pure copper, flies around despite its weight, it's a pity that it can't be sold, although it won't cost much.
	NPC_Copper_3: An interesting situation: this zombie was covered with pure copper when he died, he was probably rich during his life, it’s a pity that he can’t be sold, although he won’t be worth much.
	NPC_Amethyst_1: This slime is a relative of the black slime, but it absorbed and merged with amethyst, receiving magical power from it.
	NPC_Amethyst_2: This demonic eye was overgrown with amethysts, thanks to which it received its magical power, but why the gems parasitize on living organisms is a mystery.
	NPC_Zombie_2: This eye wandered around the world for a very long time and died of old age, but it was resurrected and continues to do the same as it did during life.
	NPC_Topaz_1: This slime is a relative of the black slime, but it absorbed and merged with topaz, receiving magical power from it.
	NPC_Topaz_2: This demonic eye was overgrown with topazes, thanks to which it received its magical power, but why the gems parasitize on living organisms is a mystery.
	NPC_Diamond_1: This slime is a relative of the black slime, but it absorbed and merged with diamond, receiving magical power from it.
	NPC_Diamond_2: This demonic eye was overgrown with diamonds, thanks to which it received its magical power, but why the gems parasitize on living organisms is a mystery.
	NPC_Sapphire_1: This slime is a relative of the black slime, but it absorbed and merged with sapphire, receiving magical power from it.
	NPC_Sapphire_2: This demonic eye was overgrown with sapphires, thanks to which it received its magical power, but why the gems parasitize on living organisms is a mystery.
	NPC_Emerald_1: This slime is a relative of the black slime, but it absorbed and merged with emerald, receiving magical power from it.
	NPC_Emerald_2: This demonic eye was overgrown with emeralds, thanks to which it received its magical power, but why the gems parasitize on living organisms is a mystery.
	NPC_Ruby_1: This slime is a relative of the black slime, but it absorbed and merged with ruby, receiving magical power from it.
	NPC_Ruby_2: This demonic eye was overgrown with rubies, thanks to which it received its magical power, but why the gems parasitize on living organisms is a mystery.
	NPC_Slime_2: This eye was unlucky and was swallowed by a slime that merged with it. Now this slime flies around and swallows fallen leaves and birds that it meets on the way.
	NPC_Stone_1: Surviving in the dark depths of caves, this slime ate small pebbles, which is why it grew a stone shell.
	NPC_Solar_1: The seal is broken and ancient beings are awakening. The sun slime is the revived solar matter that has not acquired its true form.
}
